{"id":"wb-7-1186","name":"高贤寿圣寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"高贤寿圣寺塔","text":"高贤寿圣寺塔，位于中华人民共和国河南省周口市太康县高贤乡寿圣寺旧址。该塔始建于宋代，明正德十三年（1518年）重建，1986年11月被公布为第二批河南省文物保护单位，2013年3月被公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。该塔为一座斜塔，疑因东北侧地基松软，导致塔身向东北方向倾斜约15度。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%AB%98%E8%B4%A4%E5%AF%BF%E5%9C%A3%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":85616739,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85616739","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6967a764ced89ffcd846a725.jpg","title":"20240806_Pagoda_of_Shousheng_Temple_in_Gaoxian_04.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240806_Pagoda_of_Shousheng_Temple_in_Gaoxian_04.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/80/20240806_Pagoda_of_Shousheng_Temple_in_Gaoxian_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​高贤寿圣寺塔，第七批全国重点文物保护单位","width":320,"height":480}}